                                text="&lt;p>We&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;our deep understanding of human biology and&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;research technologies to find new ways to improve the lives of people with cancer. Our scientific discoveries have&amp;nbsp;made&amp;nbsp;a big impact&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the treatment of blood cancer, and&amp;nbsp;now&amp;nbsp;we're&amp;nbsp;expanding our knowledge to&amp;nbsp;investigate&amp;nbsp;solid tumors.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
